    my $result = $r_plot->background($color);

Sets the fill color of the whole canvas, like R's C<par(bg =)>.

Calls the C++ method C<datamunge::graphics::RPlot::background>.

The default is white C<{255, 255, 255}>. The color fills the margins as well as the
plotting area. Its alpha is ignored: the background is always drawn opaque.

