Adds a horizontal reference line at y = C<y_value>, like R's C<abline(h = y_value)>.

Calls the C++ method C<datamunge::graphics::RPlot::abline_h>.

Same as C<abline(y_value, 0.0, color, stroke_width)>: drawn beneath the data and not
