    my $result = $ensemble_kalman_filter->state();

Calls the C++ method C<datamunge::filter::EnsembleKalmanFilter::state>.

Returns array reference of number.

=cut

sub state {
    return Datamunge::Rosetta::call(1061, [@_]);
}

=head2 covariance

    my $result = $ensemble_kalman_filter->covariance();

Calls the C++ method C<datamunge::filter::EnsembleKalmanFilter::covariance>.

Returns array reference of array reference of number.

=cut

