    my $result = $augmented_lagrangian->options();

Borrow this optimizer's stored configuration.

Calls the C++ method C<datamunge::optim::AugmentedLagrangian::options>.

Returns Datamunge::AugmentedLagrangianOptions: Const option reference, valid during this object's lifetime; no mutation.

=cut

sub options {
    return Datamunge::Rosetta::call(1584, [@_]);
}

