Parameters:

=over 4

=item C<$y> (array reference of number)

The observed series, in time order.

=item C<$options> (Datamunge::ArimaOptions, optional)

Model orders and optimizer settings.

=back

Dies with C<Datamunge::Error::InvalidArgument> (C++ C<std::invalid_argument>): If a seasonal order is set while seasonal_period is zero, or if the series is too short for the requested differencing or AR order.

=cut

