Calls the C++ method C<datamunge::Splom::title>.

A nonempty title reserves a band above the panels (none by default). show() also uses
it as the window title when no hint is passed.

Parameters:

=over 4

=item C<$value> (string)

Figure heading.

=back

Returns Datamunge::Splom: This matrix, for chaining.

See also: C<set_title()>.

=cut

