Sets one color per data row for the points (recycled); clears group_by().

Calls the C++ method C<datamunge::Splom::point_colors>.

Same as set_col(const VectorE<lt>RGBE<gt>&) for callers holding a std::vector; an empty vector
restores the single color().

B<Example>

    auto pairs = dm::Splom(dm::datasets::iris())
