=item *

C<Datamunge::KMeans-E<gt>new($data (Datamunge::DataFrame), $feature_columns (array reference of string), $n_clusters (integer) = 8, $max_iterations (integer) = 300, $n_init (integer) = 10, $tolerance (number) = 0.0001, $seed (integer) = 42)>

=item *

C<Datamunge::KMeans-E<gt>new($data (Datamunge::DataFrame), $encoded_feature_columns (string), $n_clusters (integer) = 8, $max_iterations (integer) = 300, $n_init (integer) = 10, $tolerance (number) = 0.0001, $seed (integer) = 42)>

=back

Parameters:

=over 4

=item C<$data> (Datamunge::DataFrame)

