package Datamunge::Tensor;

=head1 Datamunge::Tensor

SWIG-friendly facade for datamunge::linalg::Tensor -- a dense, row-major, N-dimensional
array that can hold float64, bool, or string elements (chosen at construction).

Wraps the C++ class C<datamunge::Tensor>.

Inherits from L<Datamunge::NativeObject|/Datamunge::NativeObject>.

=cut

our @ISA = ('Datamunge::NativeObject');
use overload
    '""' => sub { $_[0]->to_string },
    'bool' => sub { 1 },
    fallback => 1;

