Patch bases on [0, 1], one per dimension.

=item C<$points> (array reference of array reference of number)

Sample locations inside the cell.

=item C<$values> (array reference of number)

One raw data value per point.

=item C<$options> (Datamunge::SplineSolveOptions, optional)

Solver settings.

=back

Dies with C<Datamunge::Error::OutOfRange> (C++ C<std::out_of_range>): For an invalid id.

Dies with C<Datamunge::Error::InvalidArgument> (C++ C<std::invalid_argument>): If the cell has a patch, inputs are empty/mismatched, or a point lies outside the cell.

Dies with C<Datamunge::Error::Native> (C++ C<std::runtime_error>): If the local normal equations are singular.

=cut

