package Datamunge::NnModel;

=head1 Datamunge::NnModel

A sequential network. Layers are added by spec and own parameters named
"E<lt>kindE<gt>E<lt>indexE<gt>/..." (e.g. "dense0/W", "conv1/b"); batch-norm moving
statistics live in a second store. Parameters are created on the first
forward pass, when the input width is known.

Wraps the C++ class C<datamunge::nn::NnModel>.

Inherits from L<Datamunge::NativeObject|/Datamunge::NativeObject>.

=cut

our @ISA = ('Datamunge::NativeObject');

