=over 4

=item C<$f> (Datamunge::Expr)

=item C<$var> (string)

=item C<$a> (number)

=item C<$b> (number)

=item C<$tolerance> (number, optional)

Target absolute error per the adaptive refinement's own error estimate; not a hard guarantee for a pathological (e.g. discontinuous or highly oscillatory) integrand.

=item C<$max_depth> (integer, optional)

Hard cap on recursive bisection depth, bounding worst-case cost.

=back

Returns number.

=cut

