An C<https://>, C<http://> or C<file://> URL.

=item C<$destination> (string)

The final file path.

=item C<$md5> (string, optional)

Expected lowercase hex MD5 of the downloaded bytes; empty skips the check.

=back

Dies with C<Datamunge::Error::Native> (C++ C<std::runtime_error>): if downloading is disabled or fails, or the checksum differs.

=cut

