=over 4

=item *

H. Sakoe and S. Chiba (1978), IEEE TASSP26(1):43-49, doi:10.1109/TASSP.1978.1163055.

=back

Parameters:

=over 4

=item C<$a> (array reference of number)

Nonempty finite first sequence, length at most INT_MAX.

=item C<$b> (array reference of number)

Nonempty finite second sequence, length at most INT_MAX.

=back

Returns Datamunge::DtwResult: Owned optimal distance and inclusive zero-based parallel int paths.

Dies with C<Datamunge::Error::InvalidArgument> (C++ C<std::invalid_argument>): For empty or nonfinite input.

