Nonempty finite first sequence.

=item C<$b> (array reference of number)

Nonempty finite second sequence.

=item C<$path_a> (array reference of integer)

Borrowed signed first indices, zero through a.size()-1.

=item C<$path_b> (array reference of integer)

Borrowed parallel signed second indices, zero through b.size()-1.

=back

Returns number: Finite forward-order sum of absolute differences on the supplied witness.

Dies with C<Datamunge::Error::InvalidArgument> (C++ C<std::invalid_argument>): For invalid finite inputs or path shape/indices/steps/endpoints.

Dies with C<Datamunge::Error::Length> (C++ C<std::length_error>): For input index/geometry bounds.

