    const std::unique_ptr<dm::DataFrame> frame(dm::data::mtcars());
    std::print("{} x {}\n", frame->nrows(), frame->ncols());   // 32 x 12

Returns Datamunge::DataFrame or undef: A new 32 x 12 DataFrame owned by the caller.

See also: C<datasets::mtcars()>.

=cut

